  "notes": "The Library 2.0.2 applies the private-archive visual redesign from the approved mockups: patterned black leather surfaces, antique-brass frames and controls, warm ivory serif typography, gold plaque primary actions, refined archive cards, a framed archive-record panel, a dedicated Add & Edit workbench with upload queue and centered preview or splitter, and the matching Settings layout. Add & Edit temporarily uses the full window workspace while preserving native Windows title-bar movement and snapping. Existing cover data, imports, splitting, zoom, drag guides, Save All, backups, archive actions, and independent verified updates are preserved."
